---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/layout/Navbar';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer';

const lastUpdated = '1 July 2025';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms and Conditions - CalculateAnything"
  description="Read the terms and conditions governing your use of the CalculateAnything website and tools."
  canonical="/terms/"
>
  <Navbar client:load />
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-8 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-blue-600 dark:hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Home</a></li>
        <li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
        <li class="text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200 font-medium">Terms &amp; Conditions</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-10">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using CalculateAnything ("the website"), you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions.
          If you do not agree, please discontinue use of the website immediately.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">2. Use of the Website</h2>
        <p>You agree to use the website only for lawful purposes. You must not:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-3 space-y-1">
          <li>Attempt to interfere with or disrupt the website's operation or infrastructure.</li>
          <li>Use automated tools to scrape or extract content in a manner that places excessive load on our servers.</li>
          <li>Use the website to distribute malware, spam, or any illegal content.</li>
          <li>Reproduce, redistribute, or sell the website's content without written permission.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          All content on CalculateAnything — including but not limited to text, graphics, code, and tool implementations
          — is the property of CalculateAnything or its licensors and is protected by applicable intellectual property
          laws. You may use the tools for personal and professional purposes but may not copy or redistribute the
          underlying code without permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">4. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          The website and all tools are provided <strong>"as is"</strong> without warranties of any kind, either express
          or implied. We do not warrant that the website will be error-free, uninterrupted, or free of viruses or other
          harmful components. You use the website at your own risk.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, CalculateAnything and its operators shall not be liable for
          any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of or
          inability to use the website or its tools, even if advised of the possibility of such damages.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">6. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          The website may contain links to third-party websites. These links are provided for convenience only. We have
          no control over the content of those sites and accept no responsibility for them or for any loss or damage that
          may arise from your use of them.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">7. Advertisements</h2>
        <p>
          CalculateAnything is supported by advertising. Advertisements are served by third-party networks (such as
          Google AdSense). We are not responsible for the content of advertisements. Clicking an advertisement may
          take you to a third-party website, and you do so at your own risk.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">8. Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify these Terms and Conditions at any time. Changes take effect when posted to this
          page. Continued use of the website after any change constitutes your acceptance of the new terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">9. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms and Conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with applicable law. Any disputes
          arising shall be resolved through the appropriate legal channels.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">10. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For questions about these Terms and Conditions, please
          <a href="/contact/" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">contact us</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer client:load />
</BaseLayout>
